      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If yt-dlp `2026.08.19` plays only video [1] and no audio with this new version in VRChat in testing, then the default `visionos` client needs to be dropped. `youtube:player_client=android,web_embedded,-visionos`.\n\n[1]: As reported on X: https://x.com/neruneruhobby/status/2090681556625191254",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
