      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For VRChat developers: If this change is needed at the source code level as a patch instead of as configuration to support this, in yt-dlp `2026.08.19` you can change the `_DEFAULT_CLIENTS` and `_DEFAULT_JSLESS_CLIENTS` in `yt_dlp/extractor/youtube/_video.py` lines 143-144, optionally updating `README.md`'s `player_client` documentation too.",
