      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "YouTube livestreams will return separate audio+video formats (234+270) in MP4 container with `visionos`, which will not work in VRChat. `visionos` will need to be excluded as instructed above for VRChat.\n\n`android` and `web_embedded` return a pre-muxed 1080p format 96 for live YouTube video, which should work.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
